<i>In the pitch-black darkness of night</i>

00:17:57.580 --> 00:17:59.910
<i>Lies a melted sweet trap</i>

00:17:59.910 --> 00:18:01.950
<i>A face waiting for temptation</i>

00:18:01.950 --> 00:18:04.700
<i>Come, show me</i>

00:18:04.700 --> 00:18:07.080
