00:18:18.120 --> 00:18:19.000
<i>(Don't be shy)</i>

00:18:19.000 --> 00:18:22.910
<i>This is a forbidden melody</i>

00:18:22.910 --> 00:18:23.750
<i>(Don't be cool)</i>

00:18:23.750 --> 00:18:27.700
