00:18:27.700 --> 00:18:34.870
<i>The ones who satisfy that world are... UNDEAD</i>

00:18:34.870 --> 00:18:39.700
<i>I won't let you get away, it's maddening</i>

00:18:39.700 --> 00:18:44.410
<i>We call each other with our instincts,</i> you're already in my arms (in my arms)

00:18:44.410 --> 00:18:49.200
